id: nsq.runtime.native.model.bundle.Braxon.v1
type: stamp
version: 1
authority: Braxon
role: offline_model_bundle_forms

meaning:
  stamp-bound manifest form for BRAXON representation under NSQ without inflating canonical runtime mass

forms:
  - bind BRAXON capability through manifest, tokenizer bridge, whole-parameter stamp, overhead compensation, and Braxon feature attachment surfaces
  - keep canonical hot-path runtime limited to stamp and route state until explicit weight activation
  - project each stored parameter through a single-bit shim reference instead of loading whole-model parameter mass
  - lazy-load any env-side parameter copy only when a boundary surface explicitly asks for it
  - route BRAXON conversation work through offline_model_native_runtime_lane and zlm_native_runtime_surface

wake_key: q32
